  "term": "ecosystem",
  "definition": "In this context, an ecosystem is the wider network around an AI foundation software platform, including the platform itself and independent projects that interact with it. It is described as a system whose health depends on factors such as scale, diversity, balance, dependence, innovation, and governance.",
